  "instance_name": "scavenging_animal_metaphor",
  "label": "Scavenging Animal Metaphor",
  "description": "The image of goats eating trash is used as a visual metaphor to imply that Muslims are 'uncivilized,' 'dirty,' or 'dangerous.' This metaphor relies on the real-world association of scavenging animals with filth and disorder, which is then applied to a human group to dehumanize them. This is a common tactic in hate speech.",
